<title>SRI LANKA: Tamil rebels kill 12 Sri Lankan soldiers in ambush.</title>
<headline>Tamil rebels kill 12 Sri Lankan soldiers in ambush.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tamil Tiger rebels ambushed and killed 12 Sri Lankan soldiers in eastern Batticaloa district on Monday, military officials said.</p>
<p>&quot;An army route-clearing patrol was ambushed by a large group of terrorists,&quot; a military official in Batticaloa said. &quot;We lost 12 soldiers.&quot;</p>
</text>
